Title: Lelang Investor App
Year: 2019
Tech: Laravel, jQuery
Client: PJB (Power Generation)
Overview: Aplikasi lelang investor dengan eksekusi cepat 1 bulan.
Challenge: Timeline hanya 1 bulan, fungsi lelang harus flawless saat go-live.
Scope: Alur lelang end-to-end (create lot, bidding, closing).
Approach: Prioritization & milestone mingguan; monolith Laravel modular.
Reliability: Load testing & simulasi bid concurrency; logging & fallback kuat.
Delivery: Automasi build/deploy; dry-run pra-produksi; zero-regression.
Result: Go-live mulus; seluruh kebutuhan inti terpenuhi.
Impact: Target waktu tercapai tanpa mengorbankan kualitas.